OL,3,ARoyals and diplomats gather in Oslo to
OL,4,Apay final tribute to late King Harald V
OL,5,
OL,6,FEuropean royals and diplomats are
OL,7,Fgathering in Oslo for the funeral of
OL,8,FKing Harald V
OL,10,FThe late king of Norway died in August
OL,11,Fafter 35 years on the throne. His son,
OL,12,FHaakon VIII, has since succeeded him
OL,14,FThe Prince of Wales will be
OL,15,Frepresenting King Charles while
OL,16,FPrincess Anne, who is godmother to the
OL,17,Fnew Norwegian king, is attending in a
OL,18,Fprivate capacity
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
