OL,3,ARoyals and diplomats gather in Oslo to
OL,4,Apay final tribute to late King Harald V
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe King and Queen of Denmark as well
OL,7,Fas the King and Queen of Sweden are
OL,8,Falso set to attend as large crowds are
OL,9,Fexpected in Oslo for the farewell
OL,11,FThe service will be held at Oslo
OL,12,FCathedral from 11:00 BST following a
OL,13,Ffuneral procession from the Royal
OL,14,FPalace. He will then be laid to rest at
OL,15,FAkershus Fortress
OL,17,FYou can follow live coverage by
OL,18,Fclicking watch live above
